C[Your stone at E5 is in atari. But one of the white stones around it has only one liberty too.

Task: Save your stone.]
(;B[ed]C[RIGHT E6 joins your stone to your other stones, with 4 liberties: that saves it too. The other way was to capture the white stone that was short of liberties.])
(;B[ge]C[RIGHT G5 captures a white stone, and its empty point becomes a new liberty for you. Capturing is often the best way out of atari.])
